# Evaluation run outputs (D-SLM5831). The deciding artifacts of a run -- its
# packet, its verdict, its replication report -- ARE committed. The bulk TREC
# run files are not: they are ~109 MB for K1 Run 1 alone and are regenerable
# only by re-executing the capture. They remain on the machine that produced
# them, in place, beside the artifacts that are committed. See the README in
# the run's own output directory for what each run's excluded set contains.
